        "Dashboard built with modular and responsive components": "Dashboard dibangun dengan komponen modular dan responsif",
        "Reduced report processing time by 40%": "Pengurangan waktu pemrosesan laporan sebesar 40%",
        "Enabled real-time issue visibility for all operational teams": "Mengaktifkan visibilitas masalah real-time untuk semua tim operasional",
